https://t.co/BHtrN5CSrt", "url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2122807824531275826"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122766777495027712"]}, "author_id": "4783690002", "conversation_id": "2122767521925230896", "created_at": "2026-11-17T19:03:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122767521925230896"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 126, "id": "1965856473084473347", "start": 114, "username": "antigravity"}, {"end": 180, "id": "2044488042933530624", "start": 173, "username": "mujoco"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Gd9dO26BUN", "end": 274, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2122767521925230896/video/1", "media_key": "13_2122766777495027712", "start": 251, "url": "https://t.co/Gd9dO26BUN"}]}, "id": "2122767521925230896", "lang": "en", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 126, "id": "1965856473084473347", "start": 114, "username": "Antigravity"}, {"end": 180, "id": "2044488042933530624", "start": 173, "username": "MuJoCo"}]}, "text": "Teaching robots new tasks just got a lot faster. 🤖\n\nWith Gemini 4 Hydrogen and the new robotics plugin for Google @Antigravity, you can connect a supported arm, practice in @MuJoCo simulation, and run tasks in the real world using plain conversation."}, "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 216, "impression_count": 56843, "like_count": 655, "quote_count": 39, "reply_count": 95, "retweet_count": 61}, "text": "Teaching robots new tasks just got a lot faster. 🤖\n\nWith Gemini 4 Hydrogen and the new robotics plugin for Google @Antigravity, you can connect a supported arm, practice in @MuJoCo simulation, and run tasks in the real world using plain conversation. https://t.co/Gd9dO26BUN", "url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2122767521925230896"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122752214586552320"]}, "author_id": "1633874951508721686", "conversation_id": "2122752256923873753", "created_at": "2026-11-17T18:02:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122752